<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine carmaker Sevel says issues $70 mln paper.</title>
<headline>Argentine carmaker Sevel says issues $70 mln paper.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine carmaker Sevel said Thursday it has issued $70 million in paper due August 26, 1997.</p>
<p>The non-interest bearing paper was sold at 91.687 percent and is part of a program allowing $200 million of medium-term paper to be in circulation at any moment.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655</p>
</text>
